  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of a rosette.",
    "A": "Halfway from O to the next rosette. OA is the radius of the rosette’s circle."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line and draw a circle on it about the centre O, through A. Keep this opening for the next steps.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Put the compass point where the circle crosses the line on the right, and draw a circle through O; do the same on the left.",
      "create": {
        "P0": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "P180": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "cE": {"circle": {"centre": "P0", "through": "O"}},
        "cW": {"circle": {"centre": "P180", "through": "O"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O, at right angles to the horizontal, and draw the same circle about its top and bottom points.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "P90": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "P270": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "cN": {"circle": {"centre": "P90", "through": "O"}},
        "cS": {"circle": {"centre": "P270", "through": "O"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The four new circles cut the first one at eight more points, so it is divided into twelve. Rule the lines joining opposite points through O.",
      "create": {
        "P60": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cE"], "pick": {"angle": 60.0}}},
        "P300": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cE"], "pick": {"angle": 300.0}}},
        "P120": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cW"], "pick": {"angle": 120.0}}},
        "P240": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cW"], "pick": {"angle": 240.0}}},
        "P30": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cN"], "pick": {"angle": 30.0}}},
        "P150": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cN"], "pick": {"angle": 150.0}}},
        "P210": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cS"], "pick": {"angle": 210.0}}},
        "P330": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cS"], "pick": {"angle": 330.0}}},
        "r30": {"line": {"through": ["P30", "P210"]}},
        "r60": {"line": {"through": ["P60", "P240"]}},
        "r120": {"line": {"through": ["P120", "P300"]}},
        "r150": {"line": {"through": ["P150", "P330"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Halve each of the twelve angles at O with a line, so there is a line through O every 15°.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The four new circles cut the first one at eight more points, so it is divided into twelve. Halve the angle at O between each pair of neighbouring points: six lines through O, at 15°, 45°, 75° and so on.",
      "create": {
        "r15": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["P0", "O", "P30"]}},
        "r45": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["P30", "O", "P60"]}},
        "r75": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["P60", "O", "P90"]}},
        "r105": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "r15"}},
        "r135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "r45"}},
        "r165": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "r75"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Mark where the 75° line cuts the circle, and join that point to the point on the left of the horizontal. Where this line crosses the vertical, draw a circle about O: it is the inner circle the rosette is built on.",
      "create": {
        "P75": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r75"], "pick": {"angle": 75.0}}},
        "ch": {"line": {"through": ["P75", "P180"]}},
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["ch", "v"]}},
        "ci": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "T"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Mark the twelve points where the inner circle meets the lines at 15°, 45°, 75° and so on. Each will be the tip of a small kite.",
      "create": {
        "Q15": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r15"], "pick": {"angle": 15.0}}},
        "Q45": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "Q75": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r75"], "pick": {"angle": 75.0}}},
        "Q105": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r105"], "pick": {"angle": 105.0}}},
        "Q135": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "Q165": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r165"], "pick": {"angle": 165.0}}},
        "Q195": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r15"], "pick": {"angle": 195.0}}},
        "Q225": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "Q255": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r75"], "pick": {"angle": 255.0}}},
        "Q285": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r105"], "pick": {"angle": 285.0}}},
        "Q315": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}},
        "Q345": {"point": {"meet": ["ci", "r165"], "pick": {"angle": 345.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Join each of these points to the one five places round, 150° away. The twelve lines make a twelve-pointed star in the middle and the sides of the kites and shields round it.",
      "create": {
        "s0": {"line": {"through": ["Q15", "Q165"]}},
        "s1": {"line": {"through": ["Q45", "Q195"]}},
        "s2": {"line": {"through": ["Q75", "Q225"]}},
        "s3": {"line": {"through": ["Q105", "Q255"]}},
        "s4": {"line": {"through": ["Q135", "Q285"]}},
        "s5": {"line": {"through": ["Q165", "Q315"]}},
        "s6": {"line": {"through": ["Q195", "Q345"]}},
        "s7": {"line": {"through": ["Q225", "Q15"]}},
        "s8": {"line": {"through": ["Q255", "Q45"]}},
        "s9": {"line": {"through": ["Q285", "Q75"]}},
        "s10": {"line": {"through": ["Q315", "Q105"]}},
        "s11": {"line": {"through": ["Q345", "Q135"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "At each of the twelve points on the first circle, rule the line at right angles to its line through O: these lines touch the circle. The six at 0°, 60°, 120° and so on make the hexagonal tile; the six between them close the shields that point between two neighbours.",
      "create": {
        "t0": {"line": {"through": "P0", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "t30": {"line": {"through": "P30", "perpendicularTo": "r30"}},
        "t60": {"line": {"through": "P60", "perpendicularTo": "r60"}},
        "t90": {"line": {"through": "P90", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "t120": {"line": {"through": "P120", "perpendicularTo": "r120"}},
        "t150": {"line": {"through": "P150", "perpendicularTo": "r150"}},
        "t180": {"line": {"through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "t210": {"line": {"through": "P210", "perpendicularTo": "r30"}},
        "t240": {"line": {"through": "P240", "perpendicularTo": "r60"}},
        "t270": {"line": {"through": "P270", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "t300": {"line": {"through": "P300", "perpendicularTo": "r120"}},
        "t330": {"line": {"through": "P330", "perpendicularTo": "r150"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["t0", "t60"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["t60", "t120"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["t120", "t180"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["t180", "t240"]}},
        "K5": {"point": {"meet": ["t240", "t300"]}},
        "K6": {"point": {"meet": ["t300", "t0"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "hidden": true,
      "text": "Mark the corners of the pattern: every point where it turns or ends.",
